= The Political Parties

**[+ spd_name_colour +]** - <i>[+ spd_name_full_colour +]</i> ([+ spd_name_english +])

**Party Co-leaders:** [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] ([+ spd_coleader_1_faction_colour +]) | [+ spd_coleader_2_fullname +] ([+ spd_coleader_2_faction_colour +]) | [+ spd_coleader_3_fullname +] ([+ spd_coleader_3_faction_colour +]) | Party Ideology: **[+ spd_ideology +]**

We are a socialist and democratic party of the working class. We are the heirs of the legacy of Marx and Engels, Lassalle and Bebel. We are the foremost defenders of the Republic.

**[+ uspd_name_colour +]** - <i>[+ uspd_name_full_colour +]</i> ([+ uspd_name_english +])

Party Leader: [+ uspd_leader_fullname +] | Party Ideology: [+ uspd_ideology +]

Current relations: [+ uspd_relation : relationships +]

A broad left-wing offshoot of the **[+ spd_name_colour +]** that emerged from the SPD split amid the Great War, and in the aftermath of the German Revolution of 1918. Although containing a range of factions, from the hard-left Stalinists to moderate USPD, they follow the path of Moscow, opposing parliamentary democracy and agitating in favor of a <span style="color: #750e0e;">Soviet</span>-style revolution.

